1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 10]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:11,380
Child,

14
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:14,020
your obsession runs deep.

15
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:16,740
Even as death closes in,

16
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,060
what weighs most on your heart

17
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:19,610
is still the Huo Clan.

18
00:02:21,150 --> 00:02:22,490
Do you feel

19
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:25,130
that you and everyone you care about

20
00:02:25,790 --> 00:02:27,540
have all been used as pawns?

21
00:02:28,760 --> 00:02:30,060
That no matter how hard you struggle,

22
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:31,660
there is no escape?

23
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:35,020
You can only watch helplessly

24
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,320
as this clan, ruled by women,

25
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:39,890
falls into decline.

26
00:02:41,510 --> 00:02:43,340
You resent that,

27
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,090
don't you?

28
00:02:49,510 --> 00:02:50,450
Listen carefully, all of you.

29
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,340
From now on, anything that happens here

30
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:52,770
and anything you hear

31
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:54,090
could be false.

32
00:02:54,510 --> 00:02:55,980
Master, then what about your words?

33
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,490
Quiet.

34
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:57,740
Remember what I said.

35
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,180
Master, look.

36
00:03:02,750 --> 00:03:03,620
There's a crack here.

37
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:09,370
It might lead outside.

38
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:18,210
I remember this place.

39
00:03:19,590 --> 00:03:20,060
This is where

40
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,210
Tu flew out before.

41
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,650
But the opening is too small and the wall too thick.

42
00:03:25,670 --> 00:03:26,570
No one can get through.

43
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,370
Master,

44
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:29,060
you keep looking for another way.

45
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,420
I'll dig here.

46
00:03:31,030 --> 00:03:31,620
You know

47
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,130
I'm especially good at digging.

48
00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:33,930
No.

49
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:35,770
From this moment on,

50
00:03:36,790 --> 00:03:37,650
none of us

51
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,060
is allowed to go off alone.

52
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,010
This opening won't work.

53
00:03:42,750 --> 00:03:43,540
Let's keep moving.

54
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:44,500
Yes.

55
00:03:56,590 --> 00:03:57,100
Master,

56
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,610
there's a larger crack here.

57
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:04,780
Give me some time, Master.

58
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,100
I'll see if I can dig it open.

59
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:07,850
Aolie.

60
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,570
Coming.

61
00:04:46,270 --> 00:04:46,700
Master.

62
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,700
Master, I'm small.

63
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:57,490
I'll crawl in.

64
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,170
Wait.

65
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,580
The shadow could

66
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,700
be hiding in cracks like this.

67
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,020
We can't rush in.

68
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,540
Master, if we're afraid of everything,

69
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,810
we'll be trapped here until we die.

70
00:05:08,830 --> 00:05:09,700
I'll be careful.

71
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,220
Be careful.

72
00:05:20,630 --> 00:05:21,290
Master!

73
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:24,250
Zhenyuan!

74
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:28,930
Quick, help him out.

75
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:29,580
Come on.

76
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:31,660
Are you all right?

77
00:05:32,310 --> 00:05:32,810
What happened?

78
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,100
Master,

79
00:05:35,270 --> 00:05:35,980
Tu...

80
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,220
Tu,

81
00:05:41,950 --> 00:05:42,370
go.

82
00:06:01,070 --> 00:06:01,660
Impossible.

83
00:06:01,950 --> 00:06:02,460
Master,

84
00:06:03,070 --> 00:06:04,140
what is going on?

85
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,140
This can't be right.

86
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,700
Tu was alive just moments ago.

87
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,250
It was moving in my arms.

88
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:12,250
Come with me.

89
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,370
We all saw

90
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:34,980
Tu fly in from outside with the message,

91
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:37,540
but the real Tu had been dead all along.

92
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:39,850
So

93
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:42,490
Master wasn't lying to us.

94
00:06:44,160 --> 00:06:44,780
Then...

95
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,460
did we really die once?

96
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,490
These murals look like the ones in Liunian Hall,

97
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,020
but the central figure

98
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,140
isn't the Otherworld Patriarch.

99
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:02,050
Of the three tricks,

100
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,370
only peering into the future remains.

101
00:07:06,070 --> 00:07:08,020
This trick will tell us

102
00:07:10,390 --> 00:07:11,660
whether we'll make it out alive.

103
00:07:12,510 --> 00:07:12,980
Master,

104
00:07:14,310 --> 00:07:15,410
this tower created

105
00:07:15,410 --> 00:07:16,250
a false Tu.

106
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,100
We died,

107
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,140
and you brought us back.

108
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:19,900
Then...

109
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,930
could we be fakes too?

110
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:29,810
If this trick works,

111
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:32,220
we'll see what the future holds

112
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,220
and have our answer.

113
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,250
If you are all fakes,

114
00:07:37,590 --> 00:07:38,490
I'll find a way

115
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:40,020
to take this tower down with me.

116
00:07:42,950 --> 00:07:44,770
We decide for ourselves what's real.

117
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:47,890
Do it.

118
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,600
Master,

119
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:52,410
if something goes wrong with this trick,

120
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,890
will something terrible happen?

121
00:07:54,270 --> 00:07:55,130
Could we end up

122
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,130
like those dried corpses in Liunian Hall?

123
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:02,580
If someone has to try it,

124
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:03,490
let it be me.

125
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:04,750
- I'll do it! - I'll do it!

126
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:05,780
- Master, let me do it! - I'll do it!

127
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,260
Enough.

128
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:09,770
No one understands what has happened here

129
00:08:09,790 --> 00:08:10,730
better than I do.

130
00:08:12,510 --> 00:08:14,090
Only I can perform this trick.

131
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,130
You just want me to perform

132
00:08:20,150 --> 00:08:21,170
all three tricks, don't you?

133
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:24,900
Fine.

134
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,900
I'll give you what you want.

135
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:31,250
I'll give you what you want.

136
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:34,220
I'd like to see what else you can throw at me.

137
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,100
I see...

138
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,420
This way.

139
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:22,820
Yes.

140
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:31,980
Something's wrong with him.

141
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,220
Wake him up.

142
00:09:38,110 --> 00:09:38,710
Master.

143
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:42,730
Master.

144
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:45,770
Master, wake up.

145
00:09:46,670 --> 00:09:47,100
Master.

146
00:09:48,540 --> 00:09:49,210
Master.

147
00:09:49,670 --> 00:09:50,180
Master?

148
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:07,980
Zhang Qishan,

149
00:10:09,230 --> 00:10:10,020
what are you doing?

150
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,260
By order of my superiors,

151
00:10:12,430 --> 00:10:14,300
the Mystic Nine are to be purged at once

152
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,940
for gathering forces to rebel

153
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,050
and compromising city defenses.

154
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:19,130
Execute them on the spot!

155
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:21,020
[United in Defending the Realm]

156
00:10:29,790 --> 00:10:32,220
- Master! - Laogou!

157
00:10:32,510 --> 00:10:32,980
Laogou!

158
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:35,580
- Master, wake up! - Master!

159
00:10:35,610 --> 00:10:36,580
- Laogou! - Master!

160
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,820
Laogou.

161
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:38,650
Master.

162
00:10:38,750 --> 00:10:39,300
Master!

163
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:43,250
I...

164
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:46,100
I don't think Master's heart is beating.

165
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:47,970
Laogou?

166
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,520
- Master, wake up! - Master!

167
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:50,300
- Laogou! - Wake up!

168
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:50,820
Master!

169
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,500
- Laogou! - Wake up, Master!

170
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:52,260
- Master! - Master!

171
00:10:52,260 --> 00:10:53,520
- Laogou. - Master!

172
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:15,250
It worked on Wu Laogou.

173
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:17,730
Liven it up.

174
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:25,530
- Laogou... - Master...

175
00:11:29,510 --> 00:11:29,980
Laogou!

176
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,530
Laogou!

177
00:11:39,630 --> 00:11:40,490
Laogou!

178
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:51,010
Laogou!

179
00:11:51,510 --> 00:11:52,010
Laogou!

180
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:55,060
- Master. - Laogou.

181
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:56,280
Master!

182
00:11:57,550 --> 00:11:58,170
Laogou.

183
00:11:59,630 --> 00:12:00,100
Master.

184
00:12:01,510 --> 00:12:02,010
Master.

185
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:06,610
- Master! - Master!

186
00:12:08,530 --> 00:12:09,310
Laogou.

187
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,100
Master.

188
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,130
Master.

189
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,980
I understand now.

190
00:12:52,280 --> 00:12:54,170
You kept forcing me to use this trick

191
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,900
so I would see the future,

192
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:56,490
didn't you?

193
00:12:57,430 --> 00:12:58,140
Answer me!

194
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,380
Am I right?

195
00:13:04,350 --> 00:13:04,740
Master...

196
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:07,330
Let's go!

197
00:13:08,710 --> 00:13:10,010
- Master. - Master.

198
00:13:36,280 --> 00:13:37,370
This is the spot.

199
00:13:40,560 --> 00:13:41,160
Master,

200
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,730
did you really see the future?

201
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:44,770
Break it down.

202
00:13:46,150 --> 00:13:46,500
Yes.

203
00:14:11,110 --> 00:14:12,220
I hear something, Master.

204
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,060
Dogs are barking.

205
00:14:13,270 --> 00:14:14,140
It sounds like Cai and the others.

206
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,220
Keep going.

207
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:15,840
Yes.

208
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:39,890
Master,

209
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:42,340
you really saw the future!

210
00:14:43,190 --> 00:14:44,500
That trick worked!

211
00:14:44,990 --> 00:14:45,340
Master,

212
00:14:46,110 --> 00:14:47,170
there really is a passage.

213
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:48,970
Should we try going through?

214
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,940
If there really is a passage,

215
00:14:51,800 --> 00:14:52,370
that proves

216
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:54,890
what I just saw was real too.

217
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:03,290
That's the truth you were trying to tell me.

218
00:15:04,430 --> 00:15:05,500
Am I right?

219
00:15:06,680 --> 00:15:07,370
Answer me!

220
00:15:14,150 --> 00:15:14,740
Laogou,

221
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:17,020
what exactly did you see?

222
00:15:18,710 --> 00:15:19,340
I

223
00:15:20,990 --> 00:15:21,970
saw Zhang Qishan

224
00:15:23,680 --> 00:15:25,060
kill everyone in the Mystic Nine.

225
00:15:33,710 --> 00:15:35,090
This tower is unfathomably strange.

226
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:39,020
What you saw might not be real.

227
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:41,130
It might be trying to turn us against each other.

228
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:43,250
Laogou,

229
00:15:44,150 --> 00:15:45,500
you need to calm down. Do you understand?

230
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:46,290
Laogou,

231
00:15:46,710 --> 00:15:47,250
stay calm.

232
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:49,650
The position of Changsha Defense Commander.

233
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,530
You take Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays.

234
00:15:51,910 --> 00:15:53,700
I'll take Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays. How about that?

235
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:56,300
Agreed.

236
00:16:06,960 --> 00:16:08,130
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

237
00:16:14,560 --> 00:16:15,380
Execute them on the spot!

238
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,530
We shouldn't split up.

239
00:16:18,150 --> 00:16:18,820
Stay close.

240
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:22,180
We may not be able to change the world,

241
00:16:23,390 --> 00:16:24,730
but I hope that one day,

242
00:16:25,870 --> 00:16:27,940
we'll all be masters of our own fate.

243
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:29,770
Laogou,

244
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,300
Zhang Qishan and the Mystic Nine

245
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,490
have always been your inner demons.

246
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:33,730
Hold yourself together.

247
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:35,580
Inner demons...

248
00:16:37,320 --> 00:16:38,100
Xiangu,

249
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,340
do you have any?

250
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,770
Has this tower told you anything?

251
00:16:55,550 --> 00:16:56,850
Then I'll ask him myself.

252
00:16:57,670 --> 00:16:58,770
One look into his eyes will tell me

253
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:01,100
whether it's my inner demons at work

254
00:17:01,670 --> 00:17:02,940
or something destined to happen.

255
00:17:04,590 --> 00:17:05,250
What about this passage?

256
00:17:07,110 --> 00:17:08,700
Once I've confirmed whether the prophecy is true,

257
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:10,420
I'll know

258
00:17:12,030 --> 00:17:13,220
whether this is the way out.

259
00:17:15,750 --> 00:17:16,660
- Master. - Master.

260
00:17:26,310 --> 00:17:27,860
You can all wait here for me.

261
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,700
If everything this tower showed me

262
00:17:30,720 --> 00:17:31,380
is true,

263
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,730
I'll take Zhang Qishan down with me.

264
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:35,660
Then

265
00:17:36,880 --> 00:17:37,570
you can leave

266
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:38,770
through this passage.

267
00:17:39,310 --> 00:17:39,770
Master,

268
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,380
when Sun Wukong storms the Thunderclap Monastery,

269
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,290
how could he go all alone?

270
00:17:42,510 --> 00:17:43,490
Exactly, Master.

271
00:17:45,310 --> 00:17:46,050
I'll go with you.

272
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,660
I have no interest in Zhang Qishan.

273
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:56,900
As I told you,

274
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,420
I came down for my own reasons.

275
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,620
Since you promised to help me,

276
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:02,900
don't be so intent on dying.

277
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:03,980
Perhaps

278
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,730
there's more than one way out.

279
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:12,330
All right.

280
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:15,810
Then let's make a promise

281
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:18,860
to leave together.

282
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:31,300
[Nine]

283
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,730
Zhang Qishan really is on the other side.

284
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:38,010
Let's go.

285
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:41,540
[Taisho Type 92 Heavy Grenade Discharger]

286
00:18:51,160 --> 00:18:51,420
Master,

287
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:53,180
we can confirm the transmissions are automated.

288
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:55,330
There should be an automatic transmitter below,

289
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:56,490
sending a telegram once a day.

290
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:57,900
And the batteries

291
00:18:58,160 --> 00:18:59,180
can last a very long time.

292
00:19:00,110 --> 00:19:00,530
Good.

293
00:19:02,070 --> 00:19:03,180
Dead or alive,

294
00:19:03,750 --> 00:19:05,420
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama is down there.

295
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,090
Master,

296
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:10,250
should we try contacting him,

297
00:19:10,550 --> 00:19:11,570
pretend to be the Japanese sent to meet him,

298
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:12,380
and trick him?

299
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:14,250
He won't fall for it so easily.

300
00:19:15,510 --> 00:19:16,570
He must be

301
00:19:16,590 --> 00:19:17,490
an extremely cautious man.

302
00:19:19,350 --> 00:19:20,180
These telegrams

303
00:19:21,030 --> 00:19:21,770
could be a trap.

304
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:23,050
Don't act rashly.

305
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:24,330
Understood.

306
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:29,730
Master Zhang,

307
00:19:30,400 --> 00:19:31,490
that's Laogou's whistle.

308
00:19:32,510 --> 00:19:33,090
Keep searching.

309
00:19:39,150 --> 00:19:39,970
It really is Laogou.

310
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:41,250
Laogou,

311
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:42,990
you have no idea.

312
00:19:43,230 --> 00:19:44,650
Master Zhang just made a major discovery...

313
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:51,660
What's wrong?

314
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:53,540
Zhang Qishan,

315
00:19:54,910 --> 00:19:55,610
have you ever thought

316
00:19:55,630 --> 00:19:56,380
about killing the Mystic Nine?

317
00:20:03,070 --> 00:20:03,500
Laogou,

318
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:04,890
what are you talking about?

319
00:20:06,190 --> 00:20:06,620
Have you

320
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:08,620
or haven't you?

321
00:20:11,750 --> 00:20:13,410
The Mystic Nine remain a threat.

322
00:20:13,790 --> 00:20:14,850
They must be eliminated sooner or later.

323
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,490
When the time comes,

324
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:18,700
you must do it yourself.

325
00:20:27,510 --> 00:20:28,090
So,

326
00:20:30,150 --> 00:20:30,810
you really have thought

327
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:31,490
about it.

328
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,700
Then I wasn't wrong to accuse you.

329
00:20:36,150 --> 00:20:37,610
I'll finish you here today

330
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,500
and rid the Mystic Nine of a menace!

331
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:53,730
Calm down.

332
00:21:08,110 --> 00:21:09,500
Stop fighting!

333
00:21:10,910 --> 00:21:12,860
"In matters of propriety, harmony is prized!"

334
00:21:17,080 --> 00:21:18,300
The Metal Sha is upon us.

335
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:19,730
Once weapons are drawn,

336
00:21:19,830 --> 00:21:20,970
blood will be shed!

337
00:21:47,110 --> 00:21:47,530
Don't move,

338
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:50,010
or I'll kill you.

339
00:21:51,110 --> 00:21:52,340
Either stab me now,

340
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:54,410
or talk this through.

341
00:21:58,080 --> 00:21:59,250
You know why I

342
00:21:59,270 --> 00:22:00,290
brought you here, right?

343
00:22:11,400 --> 00:22:12,970
You know this tower is not right.

344
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:15,130
It's targeting us.

345
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:18,060
It's using our grudges

346
00:22:18,710 --> 00:22:19,660
to turn us against each other.

347
00:22:20,550 --> 00:22:21,180
You're wrong.

348
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:23,900
You and I became enemies first.

349
00:22:24,800 --> 00:22:25,940
That's what gave it an opening.

350
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:27,410
We can settle our scores once we're out.

351
00:22:31,520 --> 00:22:32,530
Still the same old tone.

352
00:22:34,760 --> 00:22:36,060
You speak as though you're being reasonable,

353
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:37,900
but everything you do

354
00:22:38,710 --> 00:22:40,340
serves only your own power and interests.

355
00:22:43,550 --> 00:22:44,460
I was bound by military law.

356
00:22:46,080 --> 00:22:47,410
I had no choice then.

357
00:22:48,550 --> 00:22:50,340
Shouldn't we put the greater good first?

358
00:22:50,550 --> 00:22:51,250
The greater good?

359
00:22:52,270 --> 00:22:54,090
Your so-called greater good

360
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,340
has never had

361
00:22:55,360 --> 00:22:56,850
room for lowly people like us.

362
00:22:58,590 --> 00:22:59,130
I know.

363
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,570
Officials are officials, and commoners are commoners.

364
00:23:01,760 --> 00:23:03,290
A lowly outfit like the Mystic Nine

365
00:23:03,430 --> 00:23:05,500
will always be cannon fodder for people like you!

366
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:10,340
Sooner or later, we'll die by your hands,

367
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:11,900
won't we?

368
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:14,500
Then what do you want?

369
00:23:16,920 --> 00:23:17,970
I want to live.

370
00:23:18,830 --> 00:23:20,010
I want food on the table

371
00:23:20,080 --> 00:23:21,340
and the chance to live with dignity.

372
00:23:24,360 --> 00:23:25,900
The greater good was never what we wanted.

373
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:27,530
Without the greater good,

374
00:23:29,110 --> 00:23:30,460
would any of us survive?

375
00:23:33,960 --> 00:23:35,220
You may not know this, Master Zhang,

376
00:23:36,870 --> 00:23:37,940
but lowly people like us

377
00:23:38,710 --> 00:23:40,340
never gave up even in the hardest years.

378
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,220
We survived

379
00:23:43,240 --> 00:23:44,290
on slop and tree bark.

380
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:46,740
Leave the Mystic Nine to me.

381
00:23:47,590 --> 00:23:49,220
I can keep everyone alive

382
00:23:50,000 --> 00:23:51,010
without relying on you.

383
00:23:53,470 --> 00:23:54,940
I've lived through everything

384
00:23:55,520 --> 00:23:56,420
you speak of.

385
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,250
You want everyone to survive,

386
00:24:02,120 --> 00:24:03,860
but with what little the Mystic Nine can do,

387
00:24:04,670 --> 00:24:05,650
how many can you protect?

388
00:24:07,350 --> 00:24:08,810
Perhaps you can save the few people

389
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,450
with you now.

390
00:24:11,520 --> 00:24:12,210
But what if there are more?

391
00:24:12,760 --> 00:24:14,380
What if there are ten or a hundred times as many?

392
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:16,890
And will sacrificing the Mystic Nine really save that many people?

393
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:20,180
Do you remember

394
00:24:21,350 --> 00:24:22,540
what happened at the mine?

395
00:24:23,940 --> 00:24:28,020
[The mine, several years ago]

396
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:41,450
Don't panic!

397
00:24:41,910 --> 00:24:42,690
Watch your step.

398
00:24:43,520 --> 00:24:44,450
Leave as quickly as you can.

399
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:46,570
The rest of you, follow me.

400
00:24:47,760 --> 00:24:48,740
Thank you, Master Zhang.

401
00:24:49,590 --> 00:24:50,770
Thank you for saving us, Master Zhang.

402
00:24:50,790 --> 00:24:51,650
Thank you, Master Zhang.

403
00:24:52,320 --> 00:24:53,740
Thank you, Master Zhang.

404
00:24:53,910 --> 00:24:55,300
Thank you, Master Zhang.

405
00:24:55,990 --> 00:24:57,060
Thank you, Master Zhang.

406
00:24:57,150 --> 00:24:57,620
Hurry.

407
00:24:58,790 --> 00:24:59,250
Xiaoyu,

408
00:25:00,230 --> 00:25:01,300
have them search in separate groups

409
00:25:01,830 --> 00:25:02,980
and bring me the mine owner.

410
00:25:03,440 --> 00:25:03,860
Yes.

411
00:25:27,030 --> 00:25:28,100
We're here to rescue people today,

412
00:25:28,670 --> 00:25:29,620
not to fight a battle.

413
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:31,650
Lower your guns.

414
00:25:32,120 --> 00:25:32,860
Don't frighten the civilians.

415
00:25:33,790 --> 00:25:34,650
Guard the explosives depot closely.

416
00:25:35,320 --> 00:25:36,060
Seal the detonators separately.

417
00:25:36,670 --> 00:25:38,650
There must not be a single spark tonight.

418
00:25:38,760 --> 00:25:39,210
Yes, sir!

419
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:41,380
Zhang Qishan.

420
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:44,420
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

421
00:25:46,150 --> 00:25:47,300
Is everyone out?

422
00:25:47,470 --> 00:25:48,450
Hurry and leave!

423
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:50,980
There are still people inside.

424
00:25:51,350 --> 00:25:52,100
I know these tunnels.

425
00:25:52,320 --> 00:25:53,130
Let's go rescue them.

426
00:25:54,400 --> 00:25:54,980
We...

427
00:25:55,080 --> 00:25:56,450
We don't have Master Zhang's skills.

428
00:25:56,670 --> 00:25:58,380
We're lucky just to make it out alive.

429
00:25:58,440 --> 00:25:59,450
- Run for your life! - Go!

430
00:25:59,520 --> 00:26:00,620
- Save yourself! - Hurry.

431
00:26:00,760 --> 00:26:01,650
- What's there to fear? - Leave.

432
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:02,940
Master Zhang is still here!

433
00:26:03,270 --> 00:26:03,650
Master Zhang,

434
00:26:04,120 --> 00:26:04,890
an urgent telegram from the Ministry of War.

435
00:26:05,270 --> 00:26:06,500
The troops are ordered to withdraw at once

436
00:26:06,670 --> 00:26:07,690
for an important mission.

437
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,860
Xiaoyu, wrap things up quickly.

438
00:26:10,320 --> 00:26:11,420
Take the others back first.

439
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:12,540
Yes.

440
00:26:21,590 --> 00:26:22,770
Account for everyone,

441
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:23,750
then evacuate immediately.

442
00:26:24,230 --> 00:26:26,300
Take all these overseers back to Defense Headquarters.

443
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:26,980
Yes.

444
00:26:29,230 --> 00:26:29,740
Master...

445
00:26:29,910 --> 00:26:30,650
Mind your injuries.

446
00:26:30,760 --> 00:26:31,320
Move.

447
00:26:35,550 --> 00:26:36,420
Master Zhang!

448
00:26:36,550 --> 00:26:37,290
Master Zhang!

449
00:26:37,400 --> 00:26:38,530
There are still people inside!

450
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:44,900
Those in lofty halls sit too high

451
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:46,980
to hear the voices of ordinary people.

452
00:26:48,030 --> 00:26:49,570
That's why evil runs rampant.

453
00:26:53,030 --> 00:26:54,570
There were only a few hundred people.

454
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:57,090
Just a few hundred.

455
00:26:58,960 --> 00:27:00,660
Yet you couldn't hear my voice.

456
00:27:01,510 --> 00:27:03,180
You couldn't hear me!

457
00:27:05,790 --> 00:27:07,250
I had no better choice.

458
00:27:10,440 --> 00:27:12,090
I need you to give me some time.

459
00:27:12,960 --> 00:27:13,730
Once we're out,

460
00:27:14,550 --> 00:27:15,860
I'll settle this.

461
00:27:16,440 --> 00:27:17,900
But right now, there's something more important.

462
00:27:17,920 --> 00:27:18,620
Just shut your mouth...

463
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:19,180
Listen!

464
00:27:19,550 --> 00:27:20,900
There are Japanese in this tower!

465
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:27,660
What?

466
00:27:28,800 --> 00:27:31,380
They stopped at nothing to infiltrate Changsha

467
00:27:32,280 --> 00:27:33,220
and enter the Otherworld Tower.

468
00:27:34,990 --> 00:27:36,690
Unless we find out what they're planning,

469
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,340
when they attack Changsha,

470
00:27:39,920 --> 00:27:41,090
the high officials

471
00:27:41,110 --> 00:27:41,690
and commoners alike

472
00:27:41,710 --> 00:27:42,930
will all die.

473
00:27:46,470 --> 00:27:47,130
Laogou,

474
00:27:48,880 --> 00:27:50,180
I need your help.

475
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,740
Help me find my troops

476
00:27:54,790 --> 00:27:56,260
and uncover the Japanese military's plot.

477
00:27:57,040 --> 00:27:57,810
Once we're out,

478
00:27:59,040 --> 00:28:00,290
I'll leave the Mystic Nine.

479
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:13,690
We've found their base.

480
00:28:14,670 --> 00:28:16,100
The Japanese have been here for a long time.

481
00:28:17,950 --> 00:28:19,690
They seem to be deep beneath this place,

482
00:28:20,560 --> 00:28:22,180
searching for something of immense importance.

483
00:28:24,120 --> 00:28:25,460
I want you to go down there with me.

484
00:28:30,710 --> 00:28:31,820
Perhaps you've forgotten, Master Zhang,

485
00:28:33,840 --> 00:28:35,850
but I only agreed to help you find Unit 401,

486
00:28:37,710 --> 00:28:38,940
not the Japanese.

487
00:28:41,510 --> 00:28:42,050
Still,

488
00:28:43,280 --> 00:28:44,690
after what you just said,

489
00:28:45,280 --> 00:28:46,460
I believe there's a one-in-ten chance

490
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:47,300
that you'll protect the Mystic Nine.

491
00:28:50,320 --> 00:28:51,690
I'll bet on that chance.

492
00:28:54,350 --> 00:28:55,100
I'll help you.

493
00:29:00,480 --> 00:29:01,100
Stop arguing!

494
00:29:01,150 --> 00:29:03,380
Quiet! What's all this fighting about?

495
00:29:04,230 --> 00:29:05,380
You're all members of the Mystic Nine.

496
00:29:05,990 --> 00:29:07,540
Why are you fighting among yourselves?

497
00:29:08,430 --> 00:29:10,490
Whatever the issue is, talk it through.

498
00:29:11,040 --> 00:29:12,740
Once everything is clear, you can fight

499
00:29:12,990 --> 00:29:14,610
if you still want to. Isn't that right?

500
00:29:16,120 --> 00:29:16,970
- Master Zhang. - Master Zhang.

501
00:29:16,990 --> 00:29:17,840
- Master Zhang, are you all right?
- Fifth Master, are you all right?

502
00:29:17,840 --> 00:29:18,500
Are you hurt?

503
00:29:21,150 --> 00:29:22,210
Put your weapons away.

504
00:29:23,560 --> 00:29:24,330
Put them away.

505
00:29:26,230 --> 00:29:27,100
Well, it seems

506
00:29:27,840 --> 00:29:29,300
you two have made peace.

507
00:29:32,510 --> 00:29:33,660
That's wonderful.

508
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:35,570
Master Zhang,

509
00:29:36,840 --> 00:29:37,540
as agreed,

510
00:29:38,310 --> 00:29:38,820
let's continue.

511
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:39,940
You're a man of honor.

512
00:29:55,480 --> 00:29:56,620
Aside from these men who committed seppuku,

513
00:29:57,550 --> 00:30:00,180
some of the Japanese must have gone down the shaft,

514
00:30:00,750 --> 00:30:02,140
including Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

515
00:30:04,550 --> 00:30:05,900
That was years ago.

516
00:30:07,030 --> 00:30:07,810
Anyone down there

517
00:30:08,750 --> 00:30:09,700
should be long dead by now.

518
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:13,700
These men may be dead,

519
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:16,620
but other Japanese surely haven't given up.

520
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:19,090
Unit 401's disappearance

521
00:30:20,000 --> 00:30:20,700
must be connected

522
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:22,180
to why Hatoyama came down here years ago.

523
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:29,460
Juanlian,

524
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:30,530
get things ready.

525
00:30:30,790 --> 00:30:31,730
Let's get down there quickly.

526
00:30:33,310 --> 00:30:33,700
Yes.

527
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:50,460
Laogou.

528
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:51,900
Laogou.

529
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,770
What exactly did you and Master Zhang talk about?

530
00:30:56,830 --> 00:30:58,330
The two of you are willing to work together now.

531
00:30:59,030 --> 00:31:00,090
Does that mean

532
00:31:00,680 --> 00:31:01,770
you've made peace?

533
00:31:03,240 --> 00:31:03,700
I don't want it.

534
00:31:04,030 --> 00:31:04,460
I'm not hungry.

535
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,620
If you don't eat it now,

536
00:31:05,790 --> 00:31:06,660
you may not get another chance.

537
00:31:08,070 --> 00:31:09,010
What do you mean?

538
00:31:12,590 --> 00:31:13,290
See that?

539
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:17,460
All those Japanese have already kicked the bucket.

540
00:31:18,310 --> 00:31:19,660
No one knows what's waiting for us

541
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:21,050
down there.

542
00:31:22,550 --> 00:31:23,620
If you eat now,

543
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,620
at least you won't meet

544
00:31:26,030 --> 00:31:27,140
the Underworld King

545
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,660
on an empty stomach.

546
00:31:29,550 --> 00:31:30,460
Enough...

547
00:31:31,960 --> 00:31:32,900
Honestly, Laogou,

548
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:35,050
you really have a vicious tongue.

549
00:31:36,510 --> 00:31:37,180
I'm telling you,

550
00:31:37,480 --> 00:31:39,490
if you ever scare me to death,

551
00:31:40,030 --> 00:31:42,380
no one else in the Mystic Nine will treat you this well.

552
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:43,810
Unbelievable.

553
00:31:56,500 --> 00:32:01,020
[Hurry]

554
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:05,930
You'll see many things

555
00:32:05,930 --> 00:32:07,730
beyond your imagination.

556
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,140
At crucial moments,

557
00:32:12,550 --> 00:32:15,460
be one step ahead of Zhang Qishan and Wu Laogou.

558
00:32:45,550 --> 00:32:48,460
This shaft was so carefully concealed.

559
00:32:48,750 --> 00:32:50,570
It must be the only way down.

560
00:32:52,310 --> 00:32:54,770
Yin Changsheng's secret may well lie below.

561
00:32:55,880 --> 00:32:57,420
According to the notes,

562
00:32:57,960 --> 00:33:00,010
this shaft should be 600 meters deep.

563
00:33:00,480 --> 00:33:01,420
Six hundred meters?

564
00:33:04,240 --> 00:33:04,700
Master Zhang,

565
00:33:05,350 --> 00:33:06,700
how long will it take us to reach the bottom?

566
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:10,860
If the records kept by the Japanese are accurate,

567
00:33:12,270 --> 00:33:12,860
down there

568
00:33:13,750 --> 00:33:15,290
lies the very heart of the Underworld,

569
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:18,460
which means it is extremely dangerous.

570
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,290
We must proceed

571
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:23,810
with utmost caution.

572
00:33:25,350 --> 00:33:26,570
The men up here are dead,

573
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:29,220
but we don't know what's waiting below.

574
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:36,380
Master Zhang,

575
00:33:37,350 --> 00:33:39,980
let's take the lead this time.

576
00:33:45,200 --> 00:33:46,700
If Unit 401 really is down there,

577
00:33:47,440 --> 00:33:48,700
things will only get more complicated.

578
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,380
Whatever happens, don't fire.

579
00:33:59,880 --> 00:34:00,290
Xiangu!

580
00:34:01,240 --> 00:34:01,980
Xiangu!

581
00:34:09,070 --> 00:34:10,380
Why did Miss Huo go down alone?

582
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:18,690
What did Ding tell you?

583
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,570
He wanted me to go down as his spy

584
00:34:21,510 --> 00:34:23,980
to find out what was happening below.

585
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,050
Juanlian, Tianpeng,

586
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:34,300
come down with me.

587
00:34:35,070 --> 00:34:35,650
The other three

588
00:34:36,150 --> 00:34:36,940
stay here.

589
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:37,650
Yes.

590
00:34:38,150 --> 00:34:38,610
Master...

591
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:54,860
Why is it so misty?

592
00:34:55,070 --> 00:34:56,300
It must be very cold below.

593
00:35:11,360 --> 00:35:11,740
Tiezui.

594
00:35:22,550 --> 00:35:23,010
Master Zhang,

595
00:35:23,800 --> 00:35:24,860
these carvings

596
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:26,820
tell the story of Yin Changsheng's life.

597
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:31,690
There's another one here.

598
00:35:33,030 --> 00:35:33,860
This one

599
00:35:34,550 --> 00:35:35,860
is about this shaft.

600
00:35:36,230 --> 00:35:36,570
Wait.

601
00:35:37,230 --> 00:35:38,210
This shaft

602
00:35:38,920 --> 00:35:40,130
has a name of its own.

603
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:44,010
Yin Changsheng was so fond of it

604
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:45,940
that he treated it like a pet.

605
00:35:48,030 --> 00:35:49,170
He even gave it a name:

606
00:35:50,150 --> 00:35:50,980
Luotian.

607
00:35:59,000 --> 00:35:59,940
A shaft as a pet?

608
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,530
I've heard Westerners speak of lunatics like that.

609
00:36:02,840 --> 00:36:03,940
Exactly.

610
00:36:04,590 --> 00:36:05,490
I need to light some incense

611
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:06,900
to check the airflow.

612
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:20,530
Don't bother, Tiezui.

613
00:36:21,110 --> 00:36:21,940
Let's keep going down.

614
00:36:38,710 --> 00:36:39,090
Wait.

615
00:37:02,710 --> 00:37:03,460
This is a Japanese soldier.

616
00:37:04,030 --> 00:37:04,780
How did he die here?

617
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:12,900
No external wounds.

618
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:14,900
He must have died suddenly.

619
00:37:36,540 --> 00:37:37,820
[Infantry]

620
00:37:49,740 --> 00:37:51,140
[Top-Secret Special Transfer Order]

621
00:37:51,360 --> 00:37:52,260
What does it say?

622
00:37:52,630 --> 00:37:53,570
The transfer order says

623
00:37:54,280 --> 00:37:56,460
this man was assigned to Changsha

624
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,490
to take part in Operation Catch All.

625
00:37:59,070 --> 00:38:00,130
All operations were

626
00:38:00,630 --> 00:38:02,360
to be carried out under Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's command.

627
00:38:02,550 --> 00:38:03,940
So Hatoyama came here

628
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:06,820
to carry out

629
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:08,340
this so-called Operation Catch All.

630
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,300
Operation Catch All?

631
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:13,940
What is that about?

632
00:38:15,110 --> 00:38:16,530
And what does it have to do with this Underworld?

633
00:38:42,900 --> 00:38:47,060
♪The past fades like smoke♪

634
00:38:47,420 --> 00:38:50,140
♪A choice is made in silence♪

635
00:38:50,420 --> 00:38:53,220
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

636
00:38:53,620 --> 00:38:57,380
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

637
00:38:57,620 --> 00:39:01,060
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

638
00:39:01,340 --> 00:39:04,740
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

639
00:39:04,820 --> 00:39:12,100
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

640
00:39:12,540 --> 00:39:15,820
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

641
00:39:16,100 --> 00:39:19,340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

642
00:39:19,500 --> 00:39:23,540
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

643
00:39:23,740 --> 00:39:27,100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

644
00:39:27,340 --> 00:39:30,700
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

645
00:39:30,940 --> 00:39:34,220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

646
00:39:34,540 --> 00:39:38,220
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

647
00:39:38,420 --> 00:39:41,660
♪Take care♪

648
00:39:41,660 --> 00:39:44,220
♪We once raced♪

649
00:39:44,300 --> 00:39:46,220
♪For the dawn♪

650
00:39:46,380 --> 00:39:49,660
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

651
00:39:49,780 --> 00:39:53,060
♪In the web of fate♪

652
00:39:53,060 --> 00:39:56,260
♪No one can escape♪

653
00:39:57,260 --> 00:39:59,100
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

654
00:39:59,260 --> 00:40:00,820
♪We too were young once♪

655
00:40:00,900 --> 00:40:04,340
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

656
00:40:04,540 --> 00:40:06,860
♪Keep the ember lit♪

657
00:40:06,980 --> 00:40:11,500
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

658
00:40:11,620 --> 00:40:14,580
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

659
00:40:14,820 --> 00:40:18,340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

660
00:40:18,460 --> 00:40:22,220
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

661
00:40:22,540 --> 00:40:26,020
♪Who believes in fate?♪

662
00:40:26,180 --> 00:40:29,180
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

663
00:40:29,420 --> 00:40:33,180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

664
00:40:33,340 --> 00:40:37,060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

665
00:40:37,180 --> 00:40:48,620
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
